OL,3,GNEWSATravel disrupted and events
OL,4,Acancelled as Storm Boelo hits UK with
OL,5,Awind and rain
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing more wet and
OL,8,Fwindy weather to large parts of the UK
OL,9,F- a day after Storm Austen hit the
OL,10,Fcountry
OL,12,FFerries in the Irish Sea are cancelled,
OL,13,Fwith services on the CalMac service in
OL,14,FScotland also suspended
OL,16,FSome Scottish rail lines will close
OL,17,Ffrom 21:00, while in Ireland, a handful
OL,18,Fof flights to and from Dublin were
OL,19,Fcancelled
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
