OL,3,GNEWSATravel disrupted and events
OL,4,Acancelled as Storm Boelo hits UK with
OL,5,Awind and rain
OL,6,
OL,7,FFriday's storm brought widespread power
OL,8,Fcuts, particularly in south-west
OL,9,FEngland - National Grid says it has
OL,10,Frestored electricity to over 117,000
OL,11,Fhomes, but thousands of others are
OL,12,Fstill waiting to be reconnected
